background/named blocks/traps and parse errors, SafeGetValue ordering/no arbitrary evaluation, original schema/import/runtime safety, all existing checks preserved. Do not propose weakening guards merely to green tests.\n\nEvidence root E=/workspace/scratch/proxima-remainder-20261109/r2. Native raw fullsource E/H2-native-first-extracted (1179files+index/58phases, operatorrc2 at inert PS7 snapin), E/H2-native-completion-extracted (542files+index/31phasesrc0), E/literal-first-extracted (49files/oneactual PS51literal; operatorrc2 due null.values), E/literal-remaining-extracted (106files/fivephasesrc0). All raw ZIPs preserved alongside. E/H2-native-derived-receipt.json / combine-native.py are derived navigation, not source replacement. AUX1-oracle-receipt.json independently accepts PS7.6.9 legacyPSSnapin as inert exact defaults/noAPI; not semantic kill/waiver. AUX2-gates-receipt.json and AUX2-gates-final.txt must be actual completed fullsource gate digest before this assignment starts, not code approval. Full Linux original E/linux-H2 all10steps: real lifecycle1777/1777, strict184, Ruff12F821 baseline-identical =>delta0, admission/doctrine/docs/ADR/scope. Read source behind any material claim and independently verify cross-links as practical; no necessity to dump massive rawlogs into your context. Raw ZIP indexes permit full-source recomputation. Source exports are scoped committedGitblob bridge, not native fullGitcheckout. Childculture en-AU measured; parent cultures enUS/trTR/az measured separately. No WindowsCI/fullmutantCI ran. No activation/LIVE inferred.\n\nLiteral property normative r3 clarification: ordinary valid manifest/comments PM01+PM02/full7positive. Private RootModule literal '#REQUIRES -Version 5.1' same nine keys =>PM01PASS (parserrequirements null/default/noerrors), PM02FAIL exactlyVALUE[RootModule], rc1/runtime0/PM04NOT_EXECUTED/no setup. Six PS×culture observations are NOT full7positive/semanticnegativekill. Explicit sourcebefore/after maps equal; owned native CSV95rows=89prior+6literal only, raw selectedrows/header + sourceCSVhash; otheruserrows excluded. First operator .values() on null failure retained, no repeat firstphase. Native main firstoperatorrc2 also retained after misexpecting PS7 inert legacyPSSnapin; no source patch for oracle. Evaluate these limited claims, never rewrite failures as rc0.\n\nStable finding history: debt #1295 WP1285-R7-F01/P3 manifest-requires-guard-comment-regex, related WP1285-R1-F01 repeated class. Parent oldH4 waiver and human audit DO NOT transfer. H1=1013394e0f36c44bbf7ffb9c95d7938af1a263b4 guessed RequiredPSSnapIns and failed nativepositive (WP1296-NATIVE-F01/P2); H2 actual RequiresPSSnapIns/API compatibility corrective. H1 original native failure + probe in metadata ops/checkpoints/wp1296-r2. Inspect whole relatedclass, not just known spelling. Old P0 F1/F2 historical identity/evidence waivers remain historical, not code repair claims.\n\nQuantitative history/ref claims are frozen historical measurements; full mirror /workspace/scratch/proxima-p1-s2-20261108/holder-cache.git is provided read-only for independent remeasurement if evaluating currentrefclaims. Source evidence operators/filter scripts retained; any omission you find counts as a finding. No mandatory claim list limits scope. Report measured vs carried vs not_run explicitly. Do not claim actualhuman/cross or ownerapproval. Author2/2 exhausted, formal0/2 beforethis/shared2/8 beforethis, oneprimarypushunused; finding requires concrete checkpoint, not reviewer patch.\n\nOutput original self-contained Vietnamese verdict with full reviewed_sha/base/tree, identity requested vs measured, scope, two-axis spec_verdict and standards_security_verdict, overall verdict approve|changes_requested|blocked, findings IDs/severity/class/file/line/repro/evidence/impact/remediation direction, inherited-finding disposition, evidence measured and limitations. No invented finding merely because assurance awaits a human; code verdict can approve while promotion stays HOLD. A material correctness/spec/gate defect must block. Finish EXACT final line KET_LUAN: approve or KET_LUAN: changes_requested or KET_LUAN: blocked matching your overall verdict.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
