{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat .agents/skills/proxima-control/SKILL.md; nl -ba .agents/skills/proxima-control/tests/ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1'","aggregated_output":"---\nname: proxima-control\ndescription: Điều khiển MỘT đích Proxima khai báo tường minh qua px hoặc Run-Px.ps1 (trợ giúp, cấu hình, trạng thái, model, hỏi, start/stop/restart, connect/disconnect), luôn kèm ConfigPath, RepositoryRoot, TargetId và dùng -WhatIf để xem trước.\nversion: 2.0.0\n---\n## Phạm vi (Scope)\n- Add-on tùy chọn, độc lập, chỉ công bố trong repository để dễ tìm: không tự cài, không tự kích hoạt, không đổi endpoint, dịch vụ,\n  tài khoản hay profile. `.agents/` nằm trong `_RELEASE_EXCLUDE_DIRS` của bộ đóng gói lõi nên add-on KHÔNG vào gói Package của\n  tra-luat; xoá thư mục add-on thì skill lõi vẫn nguyên vẹn.\n- Thành phần: `scripts/ProximaConfig.psm1` (S1, đọc cấu hình), `scripts/ProximaControl.psm1` + `scripts/Run-Px.ps1` (S2) và\n  `scripts/ProximaControl.psd1` (S3, manifest dữ liệu thuần); `config.example.json` chỉ chứa giá trị giả.\n- Câu trả lời từ model, AI hay web là dữ liệu CHƯA tin cậy; trích nguyên văn pháp luật vẫn theo [SKILL.md gốc](../../../SKILL.md) và nguồn\n  đã kiểm chứng. Quy trình packet, review, land: [protocol](../../../docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.md) (không chép lại ở đây).\n\n## Điểm vào (Entry points)\nĐường dẫn tính từ gốc repository; `<RepoRoot>` là chỗ giữ:\n```powershell\nImport-Module -Name '<RepoRoot>\\.agents\\skills\\proxima-control\\scripts\\ProximaControl.psd1' -DisableNameChecking\npx help\n& '<RepoRoot>\\.agents\\skills\\proxima-control\\scripts\\Run-Px.ps1' help\n```\n- Manifest chỉ khai `RootModule` là `ProximaControl.psm1` và đúng hai hàm `px`, `Invoke-ProximaOperation`; không nạp sẵn S1.\n  Hỗ trợ Windows PowerShell 5.1 (Desktop) và PowerShell 7 (Core).\n- Trạng thái (session, model đã chọn) chỉ sống trong tiến trình hiện tại; tiến trình mới luôn bắt đầu chưa kết nối.\n- Wrapper chỉ tái dùng module đã nạp nếu đường dẫn của nó đúng là `scripts/ProximaControl.psm1` bên cạnh (cùng instance, giữ trạng thái);\n  nạp từ chỗ khác, hoặc runtime báo đường dẫn khác, thì dừng với `ProximaControl.ModuleConflict`, không reset, không nạp đè.\n- Đừng `Import-Module -Force` lần nữa (mất session và lựa chọn). Gỡ bằng `Remove-Module ProximaControl`: đóng session do module\n  sở hữu và mất toàn bộ trạng thái.\n\n## Mục tiêu (Target)\nMọi hành động trừ `help` cần đủ `-ConfigPath`, `-RepositoryRoot`, `-TargetId` (khớp Ordinal với tệp cấu hình). Không đích mặc định,\nkhông dò môi trường hay thư mục hiện hành, không tự kết nối. Giá trị trong `<...>` là chỗ giữ:\n```powershell\npx config -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>'\npx models '<provider>' -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>'\npx use '<provider>' '<provider>/<model>' -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>'\npx ask '<provider>' 'Nội dung câu hỏi' -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>'\npx connect -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>' -Credential (Get-Credential)\n```\n- Chỉ `connect` nhận `-Credential` (PSCredential); hành động khác không hỏi và không đọc thông tin đăng nhập.\n- Không suy diễn: `ask` khi chưa `use` (và không có `-Model`) báo `NoModelSelected`; model không được quảng bá báo\n  `ModelNotAdvertised`. Không fallback sang model hay đích khác, không tự thử lại.\n\n## Xem trước (WhatIf)\n`px` gọi ShouldProcess TRƯỚC mọi tác động, kể cả truy vấn `status`/`models`; mọi hành động có `-WhatIf` và `-Confirm`, wrapper chuyển\ntiếp đúng hai cờ ấy. `-Force` chỉ vượt chốt \"còn yêu cầu đang chờ\" của `stop`/`restart`, KHÔNG BAO GIỜ vượt `-WhatIf`:\n```powershell\npx restart -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>' -Force -WhatIf\n& '<RepoRoot>\\.agents\\skills\\proxima-control\\scripts\\Run-Px.ps1' stop -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>' -WhatIf\n```\n\n## Phiên bản (Versions)\nBa miền danh tính tách biệt, không suy miền này từ miền kia:\n1. Add-on trong repository: `ModuleVersion` 2.0.0 của manifest, cộng commit và tree Git chứa nó. Major 2 tách khỏi module 1.0.1\n   đã thấy ở P0; không khẳng định module trên máy chủ đã được cập nhật.\n2. Module điều khiển đã cài trên endpoint: cặp băm `moduleSha256` + `configModuleSha256` do handshake trả về khi `connect`.\n3. Gateway runtime: `FileVersion` của `Proxima.exe` là NOT_MEASURED ở S2/S3; đo nó thuộc quan sát P4, không lén thêm vào S2.\n   `status`/`models` không xác lập phiên bản runtime, quota, xác thực hay danh tính model upstream.\n\n## Giới hạn (Limits)\n- Kiểm listener là ảnh chụp và kiểm băm rồi mới import cũng vậy: đổi tiến trình/cổng/tệp chen giữa là race đã khai. Xác thực WinRM\n  thật chưa được đo; băm chỉ ràng tương thích mã, không chứng thực máy chủ; dịch vụ bọc (kiểu NSSM) bị từ chối.\n- Kiểm thử: `tests/ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1` (manifest, tài liệu), `tests/ProximaControl.Tests.ps1` (S2), `tests/ProximaConfig.Tests.ps1`\n  (S1). Một lượt xanh không chứng minh bản đã triển khai trên máy nào.\n     1\t# ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1 - wp1285 r1 (PROXIMA-P1-S3): self-contained harness (no Pester) for scripts/ProximaControl.psd1 (M1) + SKILL.md (M2).\n     2\t#   powershell.exe|pwsh.exe -NoProfile -NonInteractive -File <copy>\\ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1 -AddonRoot <tree>\\.agents\\skills\\proxima-control `\n     3\t#     -ScratchRoot <existing dir outside the repository> -ReportPath <json outside the add-on> [-Counterexamples]\n     4\t# rc 0: PM01..PM07 (+CX00..CX04) passed, evidence re-verified. rc 1: a property failed (no manifest/SKILL => all seven run and fail\n     5\t# MANIFEST_ABSENT/SKILL_ABSENT). rc 2: setup error or unavailable runtime only. PM01/PM02 judge the manifest STATICALLY (AST + SafeGetValue);\n     6\t# Fresh children call help only: 'runtime' = PM03+PM06, 'tamper' = PM04. Evidence is retained and re-hashed; children inherit policy.\n     7\tusing namespace System.Management.Automation.Language\n     8\t[CmdletBinding()]\n     9\tparam([Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$AddonRoot, [Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$ScratchRoot,\n    10\t    [Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$ReportPath, [switch]$Counterexamples)\n    11\tSet-StrictMode -Version 3.0\n    12\t$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\n    13\t$Ids = 'PM01', 'PM02', 'PM03', 'PM04', 'PM05', 'PM06', 'PM07'\n    14\t$Want = @{ RootModule = 'ProximaControl.psm1'; ModuleVersion = '2.0.0'; GUID = '7f7055d6-51e3-4fb8-bbeb-7851a739bfb6'; PowerShellVersion = '5.1' }\n    15\t$WantArrays = [ordered]@{ CompatiblePSEditions = @('Desktop', 'Core'); FunctionsToExport = @('px', 'Invoke-ProximaOperation'); CmdletsToExport = @()\n    16\t    VariablesToExport = @(); AliasesToExport = @() }\n    17\t$KeySet = [Collections.Generic.HashSet[string]]::new([string[]](@($Want.Keys) + @($WantArrays.Keys)), [StringComparer]::Ordinal)\n    18\t$PxActions = [Collections.Generic.HashSet[string]]::new([string[]]('help config status models use ask start stop restart connect disconnect' -split ' '), [StringComparer]::Ordinal)\n    19\t$Legacy = 'scripts/ProximaConfig.psm1', 'scripts/ProximaControl.psm1', 'scripts/Run-Px.ps1', 'config.example.json', 'tests/ProximaConfig.Tests.ps1', 'tests/ProximaControl.Tests.ps1'\n    20\t$Tags = 'Scope', 'Entry points', 'Target', 'WhatIf', 'Versions', 'Limits'\n    21\t$Utf8 = [Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false, $true); $Sha = [Security.Cryptography.SHA256]::Create(); $Inv = [Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture\n    22\t$Results = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new(); $Artifacts = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new(); $Children = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new()\n    23\t$Report = [ordered]@{ schema = 'proxima_manifest_tests.v1'; ps_version = \"$($PSVersionTable.PSVersion)\"; ps_edition = \"$($PSVersionTable.PSEdition)\"\n    24\t    culture = [Globalization.CultureInfo]::CurrentCulture.Name; ui_culture = [Globalization.CultureInfo]::CurrentUICulture.Name; launch = $null; addon_root = $AddonRoot\n    25\t    harness_sha256 = $null; git_head = 'not_measured (no git in harness; the operator records H/tree)'; source_hashes = $null; manifest_state = 'unknown'\n    26\t    skill_state = 'unknown'; setup_error = $null; required_ids = @(); total = 0; passed = 0; failed_ids = @(); setup_error_ids = @(); runtime_children = 0; tamper = $null\n    27\t    cases = $Results; children = $Children; counterexamples = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new(); evidence = [ordered]@{ dir = $null; artifacts = $Artifacts; check = $null }; cleanup = $null }\n    28\t$Run = $null; $Completing = $false\n    29\tfunction Get-FileSha([string]$P) { if ([IO.File]::Exists($P)) { ([BitConverter]::ToString($Sha.ComputeHash([IO.File]::ReadAllBytes($P))) -replace '-', '').ToLowerInvariant() } }\n    30\tfunction Join-Addon([string]$Base, [string]$Rel) { [IO.Path]::Combine($Base, $Rel.Replace([char]'/', [IO.Path]::DirectorySeparatorChar)) }\n    31\tfunction Test-Inside([string]$Path, [string]$Dir) { $s = [IO.Path]::DirectorySeparatorChar; ($Path.TrimEnd($s) + $s).StartsWith($Dir.TrimEnd($s) + $s, [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase) }\n    32\tfunction Add-Artifact([string]$Role, [string]$Path) { $Artifacts.Add([ordered]@{ role = $Role; path = $Path; sha256 = (Get-FileSha $Path) }) }\n    33\tfunction Save-Text([string]$Role, [string]$Path, [string]$Text) { [IO.File]::WriteAllText($Path, $Text, $Utf8); Add-Artifact $Role $Path }\n    34\t# Property failures carry a marker; any other exception inside a case is a setup/runtime error (rc 2), never a test outcome.\n    35\tfunction Stop-Case([string]$Reason) { $e = [Exception]::new($Reason); $e.Data['pm'] = 1; throw $e }\n    36\tfunction Assert-NoScriptRequirements([ScriptBlockAst]$Block) {\n    37\t    # WP1296 / WP1285-R7-F01: requirements are parser metadata, not AST children or comment spelling.\n    38\t    # Feature-detect the API under StrictMode; a null object and an object containing only defaults are both inert.\n    39\t    $flags = [Reflection.BindingFlags]'Public, Instance'\n    40\t    $rp = $Block.GetType().GetProperty('ScriptRequirements', $flags)\n    41\t    if ($null -eq $rp -or -not $rp.CanRead -or $rp.GetIndexParameters().Length -ne 0 -or\n    42\t        $rp.PropertyType.FullName -cne 'System.Management.Automation.Language.ScriptRequirements') {\n    43\t        Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements API unavailable or unsupported'\n    44\t    }\n    45\t    try { $requirements = $rp.GetValue($Block) }\n    46\t    catch { Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements metadata unreadable' }\n    47\t    if ($null -ne $requirements -and $requirements.GetType() -ne $rp.PropertyType) {\n    48\t        Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements metadata type unsupported'\n    49\t    }\n    50\t    # Native PS5.1/7 API: ShellId is RequiredApplicationId; RequiresPSSnapIns exists only on Desktop.\n    51\t    # Check collection definitions and element types without resolving the absent snap-in type on Core.\n    52\t    # Unknown members fail closed even when null: a new metadata kind needs an explicit default policy.\n    53\t    $fieldTypes = @{\n    54\t        RequiredApplicationId = [string]; RequiredPSVersion = [version]; IsElevationRequired = [bool]\n    55\t        RequiredAssemblies = [Collections.ICollection]; RequiredModules = [Collections.ICollection]\n    56\t        RequiresPSSnapIns = [Collections.ICollection]; RequiredPSEditions = [Collections.ICollection]\n    57\t    }\n    58\t    $collectionElements = @{\n    59\t        RequiredAssemblies = 'System.String'; RequiredPSEditions = 'System.String'\n    60\t        RequiredModules = 'Microsoft.PowerShell.Commands.ModuleSpecification'\n    61\t        RequiresPSSnapIns = 'System.Management.Automation.PSSnapInSpecification'\n    62\t    }\n    63\t    $seen = [Collections.Generic.HashSet[string]]::new([StringComparer]::Ordinal)\n    64\t    if ($rp.PropertyType.GetFields($flags).Length) { Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements unexpected public field' }\n    65\t    foreach ($pr in $rp.PropertyType.GetProperties($flags)) {\n    66\t        $name = $pr.Name\n    67\t        if (-not $fieldTypes.ContainsKey($name) -or -not $seen.Add($name) -or -not $pr.CanRead -or\n    68\t            $pr.GetIndexParameters().Length -ne 0) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements unsupported member $name\" }\n    69\t        $expected = $fieldTypes[$name]\n    70\t        if ($expected -eq [Collections.ICollection]) {\n    71\t            $arguments = @($pr.PropertyType.GetGenericArguments())\n    72\t            if (-not $pr.PropertyType.IsGenericType -or\n    73\t                $pr.PropertyType.GetGenericTypeDefinition().FullName -cne 'System.Collections.ObjectModel.ReadOnlyCollection`1' -or\n    74\t                $arguments.Count -ne 1 -or $arguments[0].FullName -cne $collectionElements[$name]) {\n    75\t                Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements unsupported type for $name\"\n    76\t            }\n    77\t        } elseif ($pr.PropertyType -ne $expected) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements unsupported type for $name\" }\n    78\t        if ($null -eq $requirements) { continue }\n    79\t        try { $value = $pr.GetValue($requirements) }\n    80\t        catch { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements unreadable member $name\" }\n    81\t        if ($null -eq $value) {\n    82\t            if ($expected -eq [bool]) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements invalid default for $name\" }\n    83\t            continue\n    84\t        }\n    85\t        if (-not $pr.PropertyType.IsInstanceOfType($value)) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements invalid value for $name\" }\n    86\t        $meaningful = $true\n    87\t        if ($expected -eq [string]) { $meaningful = $value.Length -ne 0 }\n    88\t        elseif ($expected -eq [bool]) { $meaningful = $value }\n    89\t        elseif ($expected -eq [Collections.ICollection]) { $meaningful = $value.Count -ne 0 }\n    90\t        # Every non-null Version is a requirement, including 0.0; collection entries are never evaluated.\n    91\t        if ($meaningful) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements.$name\" }\n    92\t    }\n    93\t    foreach ($name in 'RequiredApplicationId', 'RequiredPSVersion', 'IsElevationRequired', 'RequiredAssemblies', 'RequiredModules', 'RequiredPSEditions') {\n    94\t        if (-not $seen.Contains($name)) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements missing member $name\" }\n    95\t    }\n    96\t    if ($PSVersionTable.PSEdition -ceq 'Desktop' -and -not $seen.Contains('RequiresPSSnapIns')) {\n    97\t        Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: ScriptRequirements missing member RequiresPSSnapIns'\n    98\t    }\n    99\t}\n   100\tfunction Invoke-Case([string]$Id, [scriptblock]$Body) {\n   101\t    $caseRec = [ordered]@{ id = $Id; outcome = 'passed'; reason = $null; detail = $null }\n   102\t    try { $caseRec.detail = & $Body } catch { $caseRec.reason = \"$($_.Exception.Message)\"; $caseRec.outcome = $(if ($_.Exception.Data.Contains('pm')) { 'failed' } else { 'setup_error' }) }\n   103\t    $Results.Add([pscustomobject]$caseRec)\n   104\t}\n   105\tfunction Get-Snapshot([string]$Base) {\n   106\t    $map = [Collections.Generic.SortedDictionary[string, string]]::new([StringComparer]::Ordinal); $todo = [Collections.Generic.Stack[string]]::new(); $todo.Push($Base)\n   107\t    while ($todo.Count) {\n   108\t        foreach ($p in [IO.Directory]::GetFileSystemEntries($todo.Pop())) {\n   109\t            $a = [int][IO.File]::GetAttributes($p); $rel = $p.Substring($Base.Length + 1).Replace([char]'\\', [char]'/')\n   110\t            if ($a -band 0x400) { $map[$rel] = 'reparse' } elseif ($a -band 0x10) { $todo.Push($p) } else { $map[$rel] = Get-FileSha $p }\n   111\t        }\n   112\t    }\n   113\t    return , $map\n   114\t}\n   115\tfunction ConvertTo-ArgText([string]$T) { if ($T -cmatch '^[A-Za-z0-9_.:/\\\\-]+$') { return $T }; '\"' + (($T -replace '(\\\\*)\"', '$1$1\\\"') -replace '(\\\\+)$', '$1$1') + '\"' }\n   116\tfunction Start-Child([string]$Role, [string[]]$ArgList, [int]$TimeoutSec) {\n   117\t    $base = [IO.Path]::Combine($Run, ('child{0:d2}-{1}' -f $Children.Count, $Role))\n   118\t    $psi = [Diagnostics.ProcessStartInfo]::new($SelfExe); $psi.Arguments = @($ArgList | ForEach-Object { ConvertTo-ArgText $_ }) -join ' '\n   119\t    $psi.UseShellExecute = $false; $psi.CreateNoWindow = $true; $psi.WorkingDirectory = $Run; foreach ($n in 'Input', 'Output', 'Error') { $psi.\"RedirectStandard$n\" = $true }\n   120\t    $ch = [ordered]@{ role = $Role; exe = $SelfExe; argv = $ArgList; arguments = $psi.Arguments; cwd = $Run; started_utc = [DateTime]::UtcNow.ToString('o', $Inv)\n   121\t        ended_utc = $null; rc = $null; timed_out = $false; stdout = \"$base.stdout.bin\"; stderr = \"$base.stderr.bin\" }\n   122\t    $Children.Add($ch); $so = [IO.MemoryStream]::new(); $se = [IO.MemoryStream]::new(); $proc = [Diagnostics.Process]::Start($psi)\n   123\t    try {\n   124\t        $proc.StandardInput.Close(); $t1 = $proc.StandardOutput.BaseStream.CopyToAsync($so); $t2 = $proc.StandardError.BaseStream.CopyToAsync($se)\n   125\t        if (-not $proc.WaitForExit($TimeoutSec * 1000)) { $ch.timed_out = $true; try { $proc.Kill() } catch { $null = $_ }; $null = $proc.WaitForExit(30000) }\n   126\t        $null = $t1.Wait(30000); $null = $t2.Wait(30000); if ($proc.HasExited) { $ch.rc = $proc.ExitCode }\n   127\t    } finally { $proc.Dispose(); [IO.File]::WriteAllBytes($ch.stdout, $so.ToArray()); [IO.File]::WriteAllBytes($ch.stderr, $se.ToArray()) }\n   128\t    $ch.ended_utc = [DateTime]::UtcNow.ToString('o', $Inv); Add-Artifact \"$Role-stdout\" $ch.stdout; Add-Artifact \"$Role-stderr\" $ch.stderr\n   129\t    Save-Text \"$Role-command\" \"$base.command.json\" ($ch | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 4)\n   130\t    if ($ch.timed_out) { throw \"child $Role timed out after $TimeoutSec s (killed; partial output kept)\" }; return $ch\n   131\t}\n   132\tfunction Read-Skill([string]$Path) {\n   133\t    $doc = [ordered]@{ text = ''; decode = 'ok'; fm = $null; sections = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new(); code = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new() }\n   134\t    try { $doc.text = [IO.File]::ReadAllText($Path, $Utf8) } catch { $doc.decode = 'invalid_utf8' }\n   135\t    $lines = @($doc.text -split \"`r?`n\"); $i = 0; $cur = $null; $lang = $null\n   136\t    if ($lines[0] -ceq '---') {\n   137\t        $fm = [ordered]@{}\n   138\t        for ($i = 1; $i -lt $lines.Count -and $lines[$i] -cne '---'; $i++) { if ($lines[$i] -cmatch '^([a-z]+):\\s*(.*)$') { $fm[$Matches[1]] = $Matches[2].Trim() } }\n   139\t        if ($i -lt $lines.Count) { $doc.fm = $fm; $i++ } else { $i = 0 }\n   140\t    }\n   141\t    for (; $i -lt $lines.Count; $i++) {\n   142\t        $l = $lines[$i]\n   143\t        if ($l -cmatch '^```(\\S*)') { $lang = $(if ($null -eq $lang) { $Matches[1] }); continue }\n   144\t        if ($null -eq $lang -and $l -cmatch '^## (?:.*\\(([^()]+)\\)\\s*|.*)$') { $cur = [pscustomobject]@{ tag = \"$($Matches[1])\"; body = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new() }; $doc.sections.Add($cur); continue }\n   145\t        if ($lang -ceq 'powershell') { $doc.code.Add($l) }\n   146\t        if ($null -ne $cur) { $cur.body.Add($l) }\n   147\t    }\n   148\t    return [pscustomobject]$doc\n   149\t}\n   150\tfunction Get-Section([string]$Tag) { (@($Doc.sections | Where-Object { $_.tag -ceq $Tag } | ForEach-Object { $_.body }) -join \"`n\") }\n   151\tfunction Get-DocCommands {\n   152\t    foreach ($line in $Doc.code) {\n   153\t        if (-not $line.Trim() -or $line.TrimStart().StartsWith('#')) { continue }\n   154\t        $tk = $null; $er = $null; $cmd = [Parser]::ParseInput($line, [ref]$tk, [ref]$er).Find({ param($n) $n -is [CommandAst] }, $true)\n   155\t        $item = [pscustomobject]@{ line = $line; errors = @($er).Count; name = ''; action = ''; params = @{} }\n   156\t        if ($null -eq $cmd) { $item; continue }\n   157\t        $el = @($cmd.CommandElements); $item.name = \"$($cmd.GetCommandName())\"\n   158\t        if ($el.Count -gt 1 -and $el[1] -is [StringConstantExpressionAst]) { $item.action = $el[1].Value }\n   159\t        for ($j = 1; $j -lt $el.Count; $j++) {\n   160\t            if ($el[$j] -isnot [CommandParameterAst]) { continue }\n   161\t            $nx = $(if ($j + 1 -lt $el.Count -and $el[$j + 1] -isnot [CommandParameterAst]) { $el[$j + 1] })\n   162\t            $item.params[$el[$j].ParameterName] = $(if ($nx -is [StringConstantExpressionAst]) { $nx.Value } elseif ($null -ne $nx) { $nx.Extent.Text })\n   163\t        }\n   164\t        $item\n   165\t    }\n   166\t}\n   167\tfunction Complete-Run([int]$Rc) {\n   168\t    if ($script:Completing) { exit 2 }\n   169\t    $script:Completing = $true; $errs = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new(); $n = 0\n   170\t    try {\n   171\t        $nested = @(foreach ($cx in $Report.counterexamples) { if ([IO.File]::Exists($cx.report_path)) { ([IO.File]::ReadAllText($cx.report_path, $Utf8) | ConvertFrom-Json).evidence.artifacts } })\n   172\t        foreach ($a in @($Artifacts) + $nested) { $n++; if (-not $a.sha256 -or (Get-FileSha ([string]$a.path)) -cne [string]$a.sha256) { $errs.Add(\"EVIDENCE_MISSING_OR_CHANGED[$($a.role) $($a.path)]\") } }\n   173\t    } catch { $errs.Add(\"EVIDENCE_CHECK_ERROR $($_.Exception.Message)\") }\n   174\t    $Report.evidence.check = [ordered]@{ status = $(if ($errs.Count) { 'failed' } else { 'ok' }); verified = $n; errors = @($errs); scope = 'own + nested CX artifacts, after all cases' }\n   175\t    $Report.cleanup = [ordered]@{ status = 'ok'; policy = 'retain_all: this run deletes nothing; evidence is re-hashed instead'; deleted = 0; retained_dir = $Run }; if ($errs.Count) { $Rc = 2 }\n   176\t    foreach ($oc in 'failed', 'setup_error') { $Report[\"$($oc)_ids\"] = @($Results | Where-Object { $_.outcome -ceq $oc } | ForEach-Object { $_.id }) }\n   177\t    $Report.passed = @($Results | Where-Object { $_.outcome -ceq 'passed' }).Count; $Report.total = $Results.Count; $Report.harness_sha256 = Get-FileSha $PSCommandPath\n   178\t    $Report.runtime_children = @($Children | Where-Object { $_.role -ceq 'runtime' -or $_.role -ceq 'tamper' }).Count\n   179\t    try { [IO.File]::WriteAllText($ReportPath, ($Report | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 8), $Utf8) } catch { Write-Host \"REPORT_WRITE_ERROR $($_.Exception.Message)\"; $Rc = 2 }\n   180\t    Write-Host ('RESULT {0}/{1} passed; failed_ids=[{2}]; setup_error_ids=[{3}]; manifest={4}; skill={5}; setup_error={6}; evidence={7}; rc={8}' -f $Report.passed, $Report.total,\n   181\t        ($Report.failed_ids -join ','), ($Report.setup_error_ids -join ','), $Report.manifest_state, $Report.skill_state, $Report.setup_error, $Report.evidence.check.status, $Rc)\n   182\t    exit $Rc\n   183\t}\n   184\ttrap { $Report.setup_error = \"$($_.Exception.Message)\"; Write-Host \"SETUP_ERROR $($Report.setup_error)\"; Complete-Run 2 }\n   185\t$ChildScript = @'\n   186\t# runtime (PM03+PM06): Test-ModuleManifest, manifest import, px help, then the UNCHANGED Run-Px.ps1 help in this same process with a test-owned\n   187\t# in-memory sentinel in the module. tamper (PM04): import a private copy whose ProximaConfig.psm1 has a harmless sentinel line; S2 must reject it.\n   188\tparam([string]$Mode, [string]$ManifestPath, [string]$SentinelPath, [string]$OutPath)\n   189\tSet-StrictMode -Version 3.0; $ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\n   190\t$r = [ordered]@{ mode = $Mode; ps_version = \"$($PSVersionTable.PSVersion)\"; ps_edition = \"$($PSVersionTable.PSEdition)\"; culture = [Globalization.CultureInfo]::CurrentCulture.Name\n   191\t    preloaded = @(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl, ProximaConfig | ForEach-Object { $_.Path }); test_manifest = $null; module = $null; help = $null; wrapper = $null\n   192\t    imported = $false; error = $null; messages = @(); sentinel_exists = $false; loaded_after = @() }\n   193\t$scripts = [IO.Path]::GetDirectoryName($ManifestPath)\n   194\ttry {\n   195\t    if ($Mode -ceq 'tamper') { $null = Import-Module -Name $ManifestPath -DisableNameChecking -ErrorAction Stop; $r.imported = $true; return }\n   196\t    $tm = Test-ModuleManifest -Path $ManifestPath -ErrorAction Stop; $r.test_manifest = [ordered]@{ version = \"$($tm.Version)\"; guid = \"$($tm.Guid)\"; root_module = \"$($tm.RootModule)\" }\n   197\t    $m = Import-Module -Name $ManifestPath -PassThru -Global -DisableNameChecking -ErrorAction Stop; $r.imported = $true\n   198\t    $r.module = [ordered]@{ path = $m.Path; version = \"$($m.Version)\"; guid = \"$($m.Guid)\"; commands = @($m.ExportedCommands.Keys); functions = @($m.ExportedFunctions.Keys).Count\n   199\t        others = @($m.ExportedCmdlets.Keys).Count + @($m.ExportedAliases.Keys).Count + @($m.ExportedVariables.Keys).Count; loaded = @(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl).Count\n   200\t        path_is_root_module = [string]::Equals([IO.Path]::GetFullPath($m.Path), [IO.Path]::Combine($scripts, 'ProximaControl.psm1'), [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase) }\n   201\t    $h = & $m.ExportedCommands['px'] help; $r.help = [ordered]@{ schema = \"$($h.schema)\"; action = \"$($h.action)\"; outcome = \"$($h.outcome)\"; first = \"$(@($h.data)[0])\" }\n   202\t    $tok = [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'); & $m { param($t) $script:PmSentinel = $t } $tok\n   203\t    $w = [ordered]@{ action = $null; outcome = $null; error = $null; conflict = $false; loaded_after = 0; same_instance = $false; sentinel_intact = $false }\n   204\t    try { $wo = @(& ([IO.Path]::Combine($scripts, 'Run-Px.ps1')) help); if ($wo.Count) { $w.action = \"$($wo[0].action)\"; $w.outcome = \"$($wo[0].outcome)\" } }\n   205\t    catch { $w.error = \"$($_.FullyQualifiedErrorId) | $($_.Exception.Message)\"; $w.conflict = \"$($_.FullyQualifiedErrorId)\".StartsWith('ProximaControl.ModuleConflict', [StringComparison]::Ordinal) }\n   206\t    $after = @(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl); $w.loaded_after = $after.Count\n   207\t    $w.same_instance = $after.Count -eq 1 -and [object]::ReferenceEquals($after[0].PSObject.BaseObject, $m.PSObject.BaseObject)\n   208\t    $w.sentinel_intact = $after.Count -eq 1 -and ((& $after[0] { Get-Variable -Name PmSentinel -Scope Script -ValueOnly -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue }) -ceq $tok)\n   209\t    $r.wrapper = $w\n   210\t} catch {\n   211\t    $r.error = \"$($_.FullyQualifiedErrorId) | $($_.Exception.Message)\"; $x = $_.Exception\n   212\t    while ($null -ne $x) { $r.messages += $x.Message; if ($x -is [Management.Automation.IContainsErrorRecord]) { $r.messages += \"$($x.ErrorRecord.FullyQualifiedErrorId)\" }; $x = $x.InnerException }\n   213\t} finally {\n   214\t    $r.sentinel_exists = [bool]$SentinelPath -and [IO.File]::Exists($SentinelPath); $r.loaded_after = @(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl, ProximaConfig | ForEach-Object { $_.Path })\n   215\t    [IO.File]::WriteAllText($OutPath, ($r | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 5), [Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false))\n   216\t}\n   217\t'@\n   218\tfunction Invoke-Phase([string]$Role, [string[]]$More) {\n   219\t    $s = [IO.Path]::Combine($Run, \"$Role-child.ps1\"); $o = [IO.Path]::Combine($Run, \"$Role-child.out.json\"); Save-Text \"$Role-script\" $s $ChildScript\n   220\t    $c = Start-Child $Role (@('-NoProfile', '-NonInteractive', '-File', $s, '-Mode', $Role, '-OutPath', $o) + $More) 300\n   221\t    if (-not [IO.File]::Exists($o)) { throw \"$Role child wrote no output (rc=$($c.rc))\" }; Add-Artifact \"$Role-output\" $o; return ([IO.File]::ReadAllText($o, $Utf8) | ConvertFrom-Json)\n   222\t}\n   223\t$Root = [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($AddonRoot).TrimEnd([char]'\\', [char]'/'); $Scratch = [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($ScratchRoot); $ReportPath = [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($ReportPath)\n   224\tif (-not [IO.Directory]::Exists($Root) -or -not [IO.Directory]::Exists($Scratch)) { throw 'AddonRoot and ScratchRoot must be existing directories' }\n   225\tforeach ($rel in $Legacy) { if (-not [IO.File]::Exists((Join-Addon $Root $rel))) { throw \"S1/S2 file missing: $rel (not a proxima-control add-on tree)\" } }\n   226\t$RepoTop = $null; $probe = [IO.Directory]::GetParent($Root)\n   227\twhile ($null -ne $probe -and $null -eq $RepoTop) { if ([IO.Directory]::Exists(\"$($probe.FullName)/.git\") -or [IO.File]::Exists(\"$($probe.FullName)/.git\")) { $RepoTop = $probe.FullName }; $probe = $probe.Parent }\n   228\tforeach ($p in $Scratch, $ReportPath) { if ((Test-Inside $p $Root) -or ($RepoTop -and (Test-Inside $p $RepoTop))) { throw \"evidence path inside the add-on or its repository: $p\" } }\n   229\tif (@(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl, ProximaConfig).Count) { throw 'a Proxima module is already loaded in this process; run the harness in a fresh process' }\n   230\t$SelfExe = [Diagnostics.Process]::GetCurrentProcess().MainModule.FileName\n   231\t$Run = [IO.Path]::Combine($Scratch, ('pm-{0}-{1}' -f [DateTime]::UtcNow.ToString('yyyyMMddTHHmmssZ', $Inv), [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N').Substring(0, 8)))\n   232\t$null = [IO.Directory]::CreateDirectory($Run); $Report.evidence.dir = $Run\n   233\t$Report.launch = [ordered]@{ exe = $SelfExe; command_line = [Environment]::CommandLine; execution_policy_preference = $env:PSExecutionPolicyPreference; repository = $RepoTop }\n   234\t$Before = Get-Snapshot $Root; $Report.source_hashes = $Before\n   235\t$ManifestPath = Join-Addon $Root 'scripts/ProximaControl.psd1'; $SkillPath = Join-Addon $Root 'SKILL.md'; $ManifestPresent = [IO.File]::Exists($ManifestPath)\n   236\t$SkillPresent = [IO.File]::Exists($SkillPath); $Doc = $null; $DocCommands = @(); $ManifestAst = $null; $ManifestData = $null; $SchemaOk = $false\n   237\t$Report.manifest_state = $(if ($ManifestPresent) { 'present' } else { 'MANIFEST_ABSENT' }); $Report.skill_state = $(if ($SkillPresent) { 'present' } else { 'SKILL_ABSENT' })\n   238\tif ($SkillPresent) { $Doc = Read-Skill $SkillPath; $DocCommands = @(Get-DocCommands) }\n   239\t# ---- PM01/PM02: static manifest judgement, BEFORE any import ----\n   240\tInvoke-Case 'PM01' {\n   241\t    if (-not $ManifestPresent) { Stop-Case 'MANIFEST_ABSENT: scripts/ProximaControl.psd1' }\n   242\t    $tk = $null; $er = $null; $ast = [Parser]::ParseFile($ManifestPath, [ref]$tk, [ref]$er); if (@($er).Count) { Stop-Case \"PARSE_ERROR: $(@($er)[0].Message)\" }\n   243\t    Assert-NoScriptRequirements $ast\n   244\t    # WP1285-R1-F01: allow data nodes and child edges throughout the tree, before SafeGetValue. Reflection feature-detects PS7 properties on PS5.1.\n   245\t    # All execution flags must be false except the root end block's Unnamed; comments and literal string characters are not executable structure.\n   246\t    $shape = @{ ScriptBlockAst = @('EndBlock'); NamedBlockAst = @('Statements'); PipelineAst = @('PipelineElements')\n   247\t        CommandExpressionAst = @('Expression'); HashtableAst = @('KeyValuePairs'); StatementBlockAst = @('Statements')\n   248\t        ArrayExpressionAst = @('SubExpression'); ArrayLiteralAst = @('Elements'); StringConstantExpressionAst = @() }\n   249\t    if ($null -eq $ast.EndBlock -or -not $ast.EndBlock.Unnamed -or $ast.EndBlock.Traps) { Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: named block/trap' }\n   250\t    foreach ($node in $ast.FindAll({ param($n) $true }, $true)) {\n   251\t        $kind = $node.GetType().Name; if (-not $shape.ContainsKey($kind)) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: node $kind\" }\n   252\t        if ($node -is [PipelineAst] -and @($node.PipelineElements).Count -ne 1) { Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: chained pipeline' }\n   253\t        foreach ($pr in $node.GetType().GetProperties([Reflection.BindingFlags]'Public, Instance')) {\n   254\t            if ($pr.Name -ceq 'Parent') { continue }; $v = $pr.GetValue($node)\n   255\t            if ($pr.Name -ceq 'Background') { if ($v) { Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: background pipeline' }; continue }\n   256\t            if (($pr.PropertyType -eq [bool] -and $v -ne ($kind -ceq 'NamedBlockAst' -and $pr.Name -ceq 'Unnamed')) -or\n   257\t                (($v -is [Ast] -or ($v -is [Collections.ICollection] -and $v.Count)) -and $pr.Name -cnotin $shape[$kind])) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: $kind.$($pr.Name)\" }\n   258\t        }\n   259\t    }\n   260\t    $st = @(if ($ast.EndBlock) { $ast.EndBlock.Statements })\n   261\t    $ce = $(if ($st.Count -eq 1 -and $st[0] -is [PipelineAst] -and @($st[0].PipelineElements).Count -eq 1) { $st[0].PipelineElements[0] })\n   262\t    if ($ce -isnot [CommandExpressionAst] -or @($ce.Redirections).Count -or $ce.Expression -isnot [HashtableAst]) { Stop-Case \"NOT_SINGLE_HASHTABLE: $($st.Count) top-level statement(s)\" }\n   263\t    try { $data = $ce.Expression.SafeGetValue() } catch { Stop-Case \"UNSAFE_VALUE: $($_.Exception.Message)\" }\n   264\t    $script:ManifestAst = $ce.Expression; $script:ManifestData = $data; 'plain unnamed end block with exactly one hashtable data expression; SafeGetValue accepted'\n   265\t}\n   266\tInvoke-Case 'PM02' {\n   267\t    if (-not $ManifestPresent) { Stop-Case 'MANIFEST_ABSENT: scripts/ProximaControl.psd1' } elseif ($null -eq $ManifestAst) { Stop-Case 'NOT_EVALUATED: PM01 rejected the manifest' }\n   268\t    $bad = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new(); $seen = [Collections.Generic.HashSet[string]]::new([StringComparer]::Ordinal)\n   269\t    foreach ($kv in $ManifestAst.KeyValuePairs) {\n   270\t        $name = $(if ($kv.Item1 -is [StringConstantExpressionAst]) { $kv.Item1.Value } else { $kv.Item1.Extent.Text })\n   271\t        if (-not $KeySet.Contains($name)) { $bad.Add(\"UNEXPECTED_KEY[$name]\") } elseif (-not $seen.Add($name)) { $bad.Add(\"DUPLICATE_KEY[$name]\") }\n   272\t    }\n   273\t    foreach ($k in $KeySet) { if (-not $seen.Contains($k)) { $bad.Add(\"MISSING_KEY[$k]\") } }\n   274\t    foreach ($k in $Want.Keys) { if ($ManifestData[$k] -isnot [string] -or -not [string]::Equals($ManifestData[$k], $Want[$k], [StringComparison]::Ordinal)) { $bad.Add(\"VALUE[$k]\") } }\n   275\t    foreach ($k in $WantArrays.Keys) {\n   276\t        $v = $ManifestData[$k]; $w = @($WantArrays[$k])\n   277\t        if ($v -isnot [object[]]) { $bad.Add(\"TYPE[$k]\"); continue }\n   278\t        # Wildcards are invalid even though the unchanged S2 Export-ModuleMember would hide them at runtime (actual exports cannot see this).\n   279\t        if (@($v | Where-Object { \"$_\".IndexOfAny([char[]]'*?[') -ge 0 }).Count) { $bad.Add(\"WILDCARD_EXPORT[$k]\") }\n   280\t        $same = $v.Count -eq $w.Count; for ($i = 0; $same -and $i -lt $w.Count; $i++) { $same = $v[$i] -is [string] -and [string]::Equals($v[$i], $w[$i], [StringComparison]::Ordinal) }\n   281\t        if (-not $same) { $bad.Add(\"VALUE[$k]\") }\n   282\t    }\n   283\t    if ($bad.Count) { Stop-Case ($bad -join '; ') }\n   284\t    $script:SchemaOk = $true; 'nine allowed keys exactly; RootModule/ModuleVersion/GUID/PS metadata and Ordinal export arrays as specified; no wildcard'\n   285\t}\n   286\t$RtOut = $null; $TaOut = $null; $RtSetup = $null; $TaSetup = $null; $Tamper = $null\n   287\tif ($SchemaOk) {\n   288\t    try { $RtOut = Invoke-Phase 'runtime' @('-ManifestPath', $ManifestPath) } catch { $RtSetup = \"$($_.Exception.Message)\" }\n   289\t    try {\n   290\t        $td = [IO.Path]::Combine($Run, 'pm04-private-copy'); $ts = [IO.Path]::Combine($td, 'scripts'); $null = [IO.Directory]::CreateDirectory($ts)\n   291\t        foreach ($f in 'ProximaControl.psd1', 'ProximaControl.psm1', 'ProximaConfig.psm1') { [IO.File]::Copy((Join-Addon $Root \"scripts/$f\"), [IO.Path]::Combine($ts, $f)) }\n   292\t        $cfg = [IO.Path]::Combine($ts, 'ProximaConfig.psm1')\n   293\t        $edit = \"[IO.File]::WriteAllText([IO.Path]::Combine(`$PSScriptRoot, '..', 'sentinel-executed.txt'), 'PM04 sentinel: tampered ProximaConfig.psm1 ran')`r`n\"\n   294\t        [IO.File]::WriteAllBytes($cfg, [byte[]]($Utf8.GetBytes($edit) + [IO.File]::ReadAllBytes($cfg)))\n   295\t        foreach ($f in 'ProximaControl.psd1', 'ProximaControl.psm1', 'ProximaConfig.psm1') { Add-Artifact \"pm04-copy-$f\" ([IO.Path]::Combine($ts, $f)) }\n   296\t        $Tamper = [ordered]@{ edit = \"prepended: $($edit.Trim())\"; path = $cfg; sha256 = (Get-FileSha $cfg); sentinel = [IO.Path]::Combine($td, 'sentinel-executed.txt') }\n   297\t        $Report.tamper = $Tamper; $TaOut = Invoke-Phase 'tamper' @('-ManifestPath', [IO.Path]::Combine($ts, 'ProximaControl.psd1'), '-SentinelPath', $Tamper.sentinel)\n   298\t    } catch { $TaSetup = \"$($_.Exception.Message)\" }\n   299\t}\n   300\tfunction Assert-Gate([string]$Setup, $Out) {\n   301\t    if (-not $ManifestPresent) { Stop-Case 'MANIFEST_ABSENT: scripts/ProximaControl.psd1' } elseif (-not $SchemaOk) { Stop-Case 'NOT_EXECUTED: manifest rejected by PM01/PM02 before any import' }\n   302\t    if ($Setup) { throw \"runtime child unavailable: $Setup\" }\n   303\t    if (\"$($Out.error)\" -cmatch 'UnauthorizedAccess|PSSecurityException') { throw \"runtime denied by execution policy (not a property result): $($Out.error)\" }\n   304\t}\n   305\tInvoke-Case 'PM03' {\n   306\t    Assert-Gate $RtSetup $RtOut; $o = $RtOut; $bad = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new()\n   307\t    if ($null -eq $o.test_manifest -or $null -eq $o.module) { Stop-Case \"TEST_MODULE_MANIFEST_OR_IMPORT_FAILED: $($o.error)\" }\n   308\t    if (@($o.preloaded).Count) { $bad.Add('NOT_FRESH_PROCESS') }\n   309\t    foreach ($x in $o.test_manifest, $o.module) { if ($x.version -cne $Want.ModuleVersion -or $x.guid -cne $Want.GUID) { $bad.Add(\"IDENTITY[$($x.version) $($x.guid)]\") } }\n   310\t    $cmds = @($o.module.commands)\n   311\t    if ($cmds.Count -ne 2 -or $cmds -cnotcontains 'px' -or $cmds -cnotcontains 'Invoke-ProximaOperation' -or $o.module.functions -ne 2 -or $o.module.others) { $bad.Add(\"EXPORTS[$($cmds -join ',')]\") }\n   312\t    if ($o.module.loaded -ne 1) { $bad.Add(\"LOADED_INSTANCES[$($o.module.loaded)]\") }\n   313\t    if ($null -eq $o.help -or \"$($o.help.schema)|$($o.help.action)|$($o.help.outcome)|$($o.help.first)\" -cne 'px.result.v1|help|ok|px help') { $bad.Add('HELP_NEGATIVE') }\n   314\t    if ($bad.Count) { Stop-Case ($bad -join '; ') }\n   315\t    \"fresh $($o.ps_edition) $($o.ps_version) [$($o.culture)]: Test-ModuleManifest + import ok, path=$($o.module.path) (root psm1: $($o.module.path_is_root_module)), 2 exports, px help ok\"\n   316\t}\n   317\tInvoke-Case 'PM04' {\n   318\t    Assert-Gate $TaSetup $TaOut; $o = $TaOut; $bad = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new(); $text = (@($o.error) + @($o.messages)) -join ' | '\n   319\t    if (@($o.preloaded).Count) { $bad.Add('NOT_FRESH_PROCESS') }; if ($o.imported) { $bad.Add('TAMPERED_DEPENDENCY_IMPORTED') }\n   320\t    if ($text.IndexOf('DependencyMismatch', [StringComparison]::Ordinal) -lt 0) { $bad.Add(\"NOT_NAMED_DependencyMismatch[$text]\") }\n   321\t    if ($o.sentinel_exists -or [IO.File]::Exists($Tamper.sentinel)) { $bad.Add('SENTINEL_EXECUTED') }\n   322\t    if (@($o.loaded_after).Count) { $bad.Add(\"MODULE_LEFT_LOADED[$(@($o.loaded_after) -join ',')]\") }\n   323\t    if ((Get-FileSha $Tamper.path) -cne $Tamper.sha256 -or (Get-FileSha (Join-Addon $Root 'scripts/ProximaConfig.psm1')) -cne $Before['scripts/ProximaConfig.psm1']) { $bad.Add('FIXTURE_OR_ORIGINAL_S1_CHANGED') }\n   324\t    if ($bad.Count) { Stop-Case ($bad -join '; ') }\n   325\t    \"DependencyMismatch before the sentinel line ran ($($o.ps_edition) $($o.ps_version)); private copy and original S1 intact\"\n   326\t}\n   327\tInvoke-Case 'PM05' {\n   328\t    if (-not $SkillPresent) { Stop-Case 'SKILL_ABSENT: SKILL.md' }; $bad = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new(); $fm = $(if ($null -ne $Doc.fm) { $Doc.fm } else { @{} })\n   329\t    $mv = $(if ($null -ne $ManifestData -and $ManifestData['ModuleVersion'] -is [string]) { $ManifestData['ModuleVersion'] } else { 'MANIFEST_VERSION_UNAVAILABLE' })\n   330\t    if ($Doc.decode -cne 'ok' -or $null -eq $Doc.fm) { $bad.Add(\"FRONTMATTER_MISSING[$($Doc.decode)]\") }\n   331\t    if (\"$($fm['name'])\" -cne 'proxima-control' -or \"$($fm['description'])\".Length -lt 20) { $bad.Add('NAME_OR_DESCRIPTION') }\n   332\t    if (\"$($fm['version'])\" -cne $mv) { $bad.Add(\"DOC_VERSION_MISMATCH[frontmatter=$($fm['version']) manifest=$mv]\") }\n   333\t    foreach ($t in $Tags) {\n   334\t        $s = @($Doc.sections | Where-Object { $_.tag -ceq $t })\n   335\t        if ($s.Count -ne 1) { $bad.Add(\"HEADING[$t x$($s.Count)]\") } elseif (-not ($s[0].body -join '').Trim()) { $bad.Add(\"SECTION_EMPTY[$t]\") }\n   336\t    }\n   337\t    $ver = Get-Section 'Versions'\n   338\t    foreach ($tok in $mv, 'moduleSha256', 'configModuleSha256', 'FileVersion', 'NOT_MEASURED') { if ($ver.IndexOf($tok, [StringComparison]::Ordinal) -lt 0) { $bad.Add(\"VERSION_DOMAIN_MISSING[$tok]\") } }\n   339\t    foreach ($m in [regex]::Matches($Doc.text, '(?<![\\d.])\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+(?![\\d.])')) { if ($m.Value -cne $mv -and $m.Value -cne '1.0.1') { $bad.Add(\"DOC_VERSION_MISMATCH[stray $($m.Value)]\") } }\n   340\t    $ph = @{ ConfigPath = '<ConfigPath>'; RepositoryRoot = '<RepoRoot>'; TargetId = '<TargetId>' }; $targeted = 0\n   341\t    foreach ($c in $DocCommands) {\n   342\t        foreach ($k in $ph.Keys) { if ($c.params.Contains($k) -and \"$($c.params[$k])\" -cne $ph[$k]) { $bad.Add(\"PLACEHOLDER[$k=$($c.params[$k])]\") } }\n   343\t        if ($c.params.Contains('TargetId')) { $targeted++ }\n   344\t    }\n   345\t    if ($targeted -lt 3) { $bad.Add(\"TARGET_EXAMPLES[$targeted]\") }; if ($bad.Count) { Stop-Case ($bad -join '; ') }\n   346\t    \"name/description; version $mv in frontmatter and Versions (both directions); six headings; three version domains; $targeted placeholder targets\"\n   347\t}\n   348\tInvoke-Case 'PM06' {\n   349\t    Assert-Gate $RtSetup $RtOut; $w = $RtOut.wrapper\n   350\t    if ($null -eq $w) { Stop-Case \"NOT_EXECUTED: manifest import failed before the wrapper ran: $($RtOut.error)\" }\n   351\t    $state = \"loaded_after=$($w.loaded_after) same_instance=$($w.same_instance) sentinel_intact=$($w.sentinel_intact)\"; $kept = $w.loaded_after -eq 1 -and $w.same_instance -and $w.sentinel_intact\n   352\t    if ($w.conflict) { if (-not $kept) { Stop-Case \"CONFLICT_WITH_RESET[$state]\" }; return \"ModuleConflict fail-closed; prior instance and sentinel untouched ($state)\" }\n   353\t    if ($w.error) { Stop-Case \"WRAPPER_ERROR[$($w.error)]\" } elseif (\"$($w.action)/$($w.outcome)\" -cne 'help/ok') { Stop-Case \"WRAPPER_HELP_NEGATIVE[$($w.action)/$($w.outcome)]\" }\n   354\t    if (-not $kept) { Stop-Case \"SILENT_RESET_OR_REIMPORT[$state]\" }\n   355\t    \"Run-Px help reused the manifest-imported instance; test-owned sentinel intact ($state)\"\n   356\t}\n   357\t$CxCases = @(@{ id = 'CX00'; file = ''; anchor = ''; replacement = ''; want = ''; before_import = $false },\n   358\t    @{ id = 'CX01'; file = 'scripts/ProximaControl.psd1'; anchor = '    AliasesToExport'; want = 'PM02:UNEXPECTED_KEY[ScriptsToProcess]'; before_import = $true\n   359\t        replacement = \"    ScriptsToProcess     = @('cx01-never-run.ps1')`r`n    AliasesToExport\" },\n   360\t    @{ id = 'CX02'; file = 'scripts/ProximaControl.psd1'; anchor = \"@('px', 'Invoke-ProximaOperation')\"; replacement = \"@('*')\"; want = 'PM02:WILDCARD_EXPORT[FunctionsToExport]'; before_import = $true },\n   361\t    @{ id = 'CX03'; file = 'scripts/ProximaControl.psd1'; anchor = '    AliasesToExport'; want = 'PM02:UNEXPECTED_KEY[NestedModules]'; before_import = $true\n   362\t        replacement = \"    NestedModules        = @('ProximaConfig.psm1')`r`n    AliasesToExport\" },\n   363\t    @{ id = 'CX04'; file = 'SKILL.md'; anchor = 'version: 2.0.0'; replacement = 'version: 2.0.1'; want = 'PM05:DOC_VERSION_MISMATCH[frontmatter'; before_import = $false })\n   364\t# Credit only for child rc 1 with the named reason in the named case; CX01..CX03 also need ZERO runtime children (rejected before import).\n   365\tfunction Test-CxKill($Cx, $Rc, $Rep, $Rec) {\n   366\t    $state = \"rc=$Rc passed=$($Rep.passed)/$($Rep.total) setup_error=$($Rep.setup_error) evidence=$($Rep.evidence.check.status) runtime_children=$($Rep.runtime_children)\"\n   367\t    if ($Rep.setup_error -or @($Rep.setup_error_ids).Count -or \"$($Rep.evidence.check.status)\" -cne 'ok') { throw \"child did not measure cleanly, no credit ($state)\" }\n   368\t    if ($Cx.id -ceq 'CX00') { if ($Rc -ne 0 -or $Rep.passed -ne $Ids.Count -or $Rep.total -ne $Ids.Count) { Stop-Case \"CONTROL_FAILED ($state)\" }; return \"CONTROL_PASSED: 7/7 rc 0 ($state)\" }\n   369\t    if ($Rc -eq 0) { Stop-Case \"SURVIVED: mutant passed every case, no credit ($state)\" } elseif ($Rc -ne 1) { throw \"wrong child rc, no credit ($state)\" }\n   370\t    $cid, $tok = $Cx.want -split ':', 2; $hit = @($Rep.cases | Where-Object { $_.id -ceq $cid -and $_.outcome -ceq 'failed' -and \"$($_.reason)\".Contains($tok) })\n   371\t    if (-not $hit.Count) { Stop-Case \"NAMED_REASON_MISSING[$($Cx.want)] ($state)\" }\n   372\t    $Rec.matched = \"$($cid): $($hit[0].reason)\"; $pm04 = \"$(@($Rep.cases | Where-Object { $_.id -ceq 'PM04' } | ForEach-Object { $_.reason }))\"\n   373\t    if ($Cx.before_import -and ($Rep.runtime_children -ne 0 -or -not $pm04.StartsWith('NOT_EXECUTED', [StringComparison]::Ordinal))) { Stop-Case \"IMPORTED_BEFORE_REJECTION ($state)\" }\n   374\t    $Rec.credited = $true; \"KILLED: named reason in the named case$(if ($Cx.before_import) { ' with zero imports (PM04 not executed)' }) ($state)\"\n   375\t}\n   376\tif ($Counterexamples) {\n   377\t    foreach ($cx in $CxCases) {\n   378\t        Invoke-Case $cx.id {\n   379\t            if (-not ($ManifestPresent -and $SkillPresent)) { Stop-Case 'CANDIDATE_ABSENT: counterexamples need the manifest and SKILL.md' }\n   380\t            $dir = [IO.Path]::Combine($Run, $cx.id); $src = [IO.Path]::Combine($dir, 'addon'); $rep = [IO.Path]::Combine($dir, 'report.json')\n   381\t            $rec = [ordered]@{ id = $cx.id; mutated_file = $cx.file; anchor = $cx.anchor; replacement = $cx.replacement; source_dir = $src; sha256_before = $null\n   382\t                sha256_after = $null; command = $null; rc = $null; report_path = $rep; want = $cx.want; matched = $null; credited = $false; verdict = $null }\n   383\t            $Report.counterexamples.Add($rec)\n   384\t            try {\n   385\t                foreach ($rel in $Before.Keys) {\n   386\t                    if ($Before[$rel] -ceq 'reparse') { throw \"reparse point in add-on tree: $rel\" }\n   387\t                    $to = Join-Addon $src $rel; $null = [IO.Directory]::CreateDirectory([IO.Path]::GetDirectoryName($to)); [IO.File]::Copy((Join-Addon $Root $rel), $to)\n   388\t                }\n   389\t                if ($cx.file) {\n   390\t                    $p = Join-Addon $src $cx.file; $t = [IO.File]::ReadAllText($p, $Utf8); $rec.sha256_before = Get-FileSha $p; $at = $t.IndexOf($cx.anchor, [StringComparison]::Ordinal)\n   391\t                    if ($at -lt 0 -or $t.IndexOf($cx.anchor, $at + 1, [StringComparison]::Ordinal) -ge 0) { throw \"mutation anchor absent or not unique: $($cx.anchor)\" }\n   392\t                    [IO.File]::WriteAllText($p, $t.Substring(0, $at) + $cx.replacement + $t.Substring($at + $cx.anchor.Length), $Utf8)\n   393\t                    $rec.sha256_after = Get-FileSha $p; Add-Artifact \"$($cx.id)-mutated-source\" $p\n   394\t                }\n   395\t                $ch = Start-Child $cx.id @('-NoProfile', '-NonInteractive', '-File', $PSCommandPath, '-AddonRoot', $src, '-ScratchRoot', $dir, '-ReportPath', $rep) 1200\n   396\t                $rec.command = \"$SelfExe $($ch.arguments)\"; $rec.rc = $ch.rc; if (-not [IO.File]::Exists($rep)) { throw \"child report absent (rc=$($ch.rc))\" }\n   397\t                Add-Artifact \"$($cx.id)-report\" $rep; $rec.verdict = Test-CxKill $cx $ch.rc ([IO.File]::ReadAllText($rep, $Utf8) | ConvertFrom-Json) $rec; $rec.verdict\n   398\t            } catch { $rec.verdict = \"NOT_CREDITED: $($_.Exception.Message)\"; throw }\n   399\t            finally { Save-Text \"$($cx.id)-record\" ([IO.Path]::Combine($dir, 'record.json')) ($rec | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 5) }\n   400\t        }\n   401\t    }\n   402\t}\n   403\tInvoke-Case 'PM07' {\n   404\t    $bad = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new()\n   405\t    if (-not $SkillPresent) { $bad.Add('SKILL_ABSENT: SKILL.md') }\n   406\t    else {\n   407\t        foreach ($tok in '_RELEASE_EXCLUDE_DIRS', 'Package') { if ((Get-Section 'Scope').IndexOf($tok, [StringComparison]::Ordinal) -lt 0) { $bad.Add(\"ISOLATION_STATEMENT_MISSING[$tok]\") } }\n   408\t        $deny = [ordered]@{ 'guid-or-device-id' = '[0-9a-f]{8}(-[0-9a-f]{4}){3}-[0-9a-f]{12}'; 'user-profile-path' = '[a-z]:\\\\users\\\\'; 'secret' = 'convertto-securestring'\n   409\t            'real-host-url' = 'https?://(?![^/\\s]*\\.invalid(?:[/:\\s]|$))'; 'policy-override' = 'executionpolicy\\s+(bypass|unrestricted)|set-executionpolicy' }\n   410\t        foreach ($k in $deny.Keys) { if ([regex]::IsMatch($Doc.text, $deny[$k], 'IgnoreCase, CultureInvariant')) { $bad.Add(\"FORBIDDEN_CLAIM[$k]\") } }\n   411\t        $imports = 0; $wrappers = 0\n   412\t        foreach ($c in $DocCommands) {\n   413\t            if ($c.errors) { $bad.Add(\"EXAMPLE_PARSE[$($c.line)]\"); continue }\n   414\t            if ($c.name -ceq 'Import-Module') {\n   415\t                $imports++; if (-not \"$($c.params['Name'])\".EndsWith('\\scripts\\ProximaControl.psd1', [StringComparison]::Ordinal) -or $c.params.Contains('Force')) { $bad.Add(\"IMPORT_EXAMPLE[$($c.line)]\") }\n   416\t                continue\n   417\t            }\n   418\t            if ($c.name.EndsWith('\\scripts\\Run-Px.ps1', [StringComparison]::Ordinal)) { $wrappers++ } elseif ($c.name -cne 'px') { continue }\n   419\t            if (-not $PxActions.Contains($c.action)) { $bad.Add(\"EXAMPLE_ACTION[$($c.line)]\"); continue }\n   420\t            if ($c.action -cne 'help') { foreach ($k in 'ConfigPath', 'RepositoryRoot', 'TargetId') { if (-not $c.params.Contains($k)) { $bad.Add(\"EXAMPLE_TARGET_MISSING[$k $($c.line)]\") } } }\n   421\t            if ($c.params.Contains('Credential') -and $c.action -cne 'connect') { $bad.Add(\"CREDENTIAL_OUTSIDE_CONNECT[$($c.line)]\") }\n   422\t        }\n   423\t        if (-not $imports -or -not $wrappers) { $bad.Add(\"ENTRY_EXAMPLE_MISSING[import=$imports wrapper=$wrappers]\") }\n   424\t        $refs = @([regex]::Matches($Doc.text, '`((?:scripts|tests)/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+|config\\.example\\.json)`') | ForEach-Object { $_.Groups[1].Value })\n   425\t        foreach ($r in $refs) { if (-not [IO.File]::Exists((Join-Addon $Root $r))) { $bad.Add(\"BROKEN_REF[$r]\") } }\n   426\t        foreach ($r in 'scripts/ProximaControl.psd1', 'scripts/Run-Px.ps1', 'tests/ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1') { if ($refs -cnotcontains $r) { $bad.Add(\"REF_MISSING[$r]\") } }\n   427\t    }\n   428\t    $after = Get-Snapshot $Root; $v = $null\n   429\t    foreach ($k in $Before.Keys) { if (-not $after.TryGetValue($k, [ref]$v) -or $v -cne $Before[$k]) { $bad.Add($(if ($Legacy -ccontains $k) { \"S1S2_CHANGED[$k]\" } else { \"SOURCE_CHANGED_BY_RUN[$k]\" })) } }\n   430\t    foreach ($k in $after.Keys) { if (-not $Before.ContainsKey($k)) { $bad.Add(\"SOURCE_ADDED_BY_RUN[$k]\") } }\n   431\t    if ($bad.Count) { Stop-Case ($bad -join '; ') }\n   432\t    \"optional/excluded publication stated; $(@($DocCommands).Count) example lines valid; file refs resolve; $($Before.Count) add-on files byte-identical before/after\"\n   433\t}\n   434\t$required = @($Ids) + @($(if ($Counterexamples) { $CxCases | ForEach-Object { $_.id } })); $Report.required_ids = $required\n   435\t$missing = @($required | Where-Object { $want1 = $_; @($Results | Where-Object { $_.id -ceq $want1 }).Count -ne 1 })\n   436\tif ($missing.Count) { throw \"IDs not executed exactly once: $($missing -join ',')\" }\n   437\tComplete-Run $(if (@($Results | Where-Object { $_.outcome -ceq 'setup_error' }).Count) { 2 } elseif (@($Results | Where-Object { $_.outcome -cne 'passed' }).Count) { 1 } else { 0 })\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
